{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000000027","bookName":"Antes del último adiós","cover":"","viewCount":1520647,"followCount":30507,"introduction":"Paula Ruiz, que padecía leucemia terminal, viajó a Suiza para someterse a la eutanasia. Allí se encontró inesperadamente con su ex novio Mateo Montero, que estaba a punto de casarse el día de cumpleaños de Paula. Descubrió que él había sido infiel durante mucho tiempo con ella debido a su prometida Lidia Castillo. Ocultó su enfermedad y aceptó ser la dama de honor de los dos. Al final falleció sola el día de la boda. Mateo quedó completamente devastado al descubrir la verdad.","chapterCount":60,"labels":["Second Chance","Love Triangle"],"tags":["Second Chance","Love Triangle"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Before-the-Last-Goodbye","bookNameLower":"before-the-last-goodbye","shelfTime":"2025-11-07 23:32:10","firstShelfTime":"2025-11-07 23:32:10","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"700001491","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":301385,"price":0},{"id":"700001492","index":1,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":191689,"price":0},{"id":"700001493","index":2,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":129267,"price":0},{"id":"700001494","index":3,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":212659,"price":0},{"id":"700001495","index":4,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":291465,"price":0},{"id":"700001496","index":5,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":217715,"price":0},{"id":"700001497","index":6,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":328435,"price":0},{"id":"700001498","index":7,"unlock":true,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":210249,"price":0},{"id":"700001499","index":8,"unlock":false,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":84126,"price":0},{"id":"700001500","index":9,"unlock":false,"mp4":"","cover":"","duration":8145